and redemption </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a magnificent noble mansion and its lush estate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex characters you’ll get to know and understand through the extensive dialogue system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read Marius' journal to delve into his thoughts on the events and encounters he experiences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve light puzzles, discover collectibles, and read documents that enrich the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide Marius through his journey of self-discovery and decide his ultimate fate </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "short_description": "A marriage between first person exploration and visual novel, blessed with a sprinkle of puzzle gameplay. Immerse yourself in a period drama that intertwines romance with murder mystery, as a young cleric who must resist or give in to the charms of a strikingly beautiful maid.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“...once its story has got its hooks in you, you'll likely want to see it through to one of its multiple endings.”<br>7/10 – GameSpew<br><br>“The visuals are beautiful and the choice to take the visual novel in a 3D explorable way was great. The puzzles are simple, but effective at pushing forward the narrative.”<br>Movies, Games &amp; Tech<br><br>“The Crimson Maid does a good job of slowly unravelling its mystery, while themes of religion, sin, and murder hang over the entire experience.”<br>3.5/5 – The Xbox Hub<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695260/894afff7e50c44157db8b0e2d495984cd7b61c9c/header.jpg?t=1786978271", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695260/9de471c1a48822ffedf3dc0939f2a9c992172867/cap